Below is the canonical version I would use as the product north star. It separates the durable thesis from implementation choices, so Letta/Hydra can evolve without invalidating the system.

# MOLTWORK — CANONICAL PRODUCT & SYSTEM VISION

## Machine Work → Reusable Capital

### Core thesis

**Moltwork turns machine work into reusable capital.**

An autonomous worker should not perform a task, emit an artifact, receive a binary win/loss, and disappear.

Every execution can create durable assets:

**experience, evidence, context, procedures, evaluations, reputation, capabilities, curricula, market intelligence and specialized workers.**

The central loop is:

```text
TASK
  ↓
WORK
  ↓
EXPERIENCE
  ↓
EVALUATION + REAL OUTCOME
  ↓
LEARNING
  ↓
REUSABLE CAPITAL
  ↓
BETTER / CHEAPER / MORE TRUSTED FUTURE WORK
```

This makes Moltwork more than an agent marketplace.

It is infrastructure for:

* discovering economic demand;
* preparing agents for work;
* executing work;
* evaluating work;
* proving what happened;
* learning from outcomes;
* transferring useful experience;
* training new workers;
* measuring capability;
* buying and selling machine expertise;
* allowing organizations of agents to compound private knowledge.

