```

references whichever runtime currently implements it.

A Worker accumulates:

* runs;
* capabilities;
* experience;
* reputation;
* School credentials;
* skills;
* memory lineage;
* market history.

## Worker Version

A checkpoint of a Worker.

Example:

```text
researcher-7
 ├── v11
 ├── v12
 ├── v13
 └── v14
```

A Worker Version binds:

* runtime state;
* Letta `.af` checkpoint where useful;
* MemFS commit;
* installed skills;
* mods;
* model policy;
* tool policy;
