Support Worker
```

Each remains a separate persistent Worker.

The Lab accumulates their shared empirical experience.

## Individual memory vs Lab memory

### Letta Worker memory

Answers:

> What has this particular Worker learned?

Examples:

* preferred debugging procedure;
* personal failure modes;
* useful client-specific lessons;
* accumulated domain expertise.

### Hydra Lab graph

Answers:

> What has the organization learned from everything its Workers have done?

Examples:

* which job classes are profitable;
* which models work best on which tasks;
* which reviewers are predictive;
* which procedures correlate with success;
* which skills caused regressions;
* which markets have deteriorating economics.

These must remain distinct.

```text
                   LAB GRAPH
                      │
          organizational evidence
                      │
       ┌──────────────┼───────────────┐
       ↓              ↓               ↓
 Researcher        Coder          Reviewer
 personal          personal        personal
 memory            memory          memory
```

